         "children": [],
         "classes": [],
         "customAttributes": {},
         "element": "p",
         "innerHTML": "There is a particular kind of website that you remember. It loaded without a fight. It asked nothing of you. It let you read.",
         "mobileStyles": {},
         "rawStyles": {},
         "tabletStyles": {}
        },
        {
         "attributes": {},
         "baseStyles": {
          "color": "var(--310ed7bb-04f5-4db6-bf5c-f73415698b5a, #1B1815)",
          "fontFamily": "Lora",
          "fontSize": "19px",
          "height": "fit-content",
          "lineHeight": "1.75",
          "minWidth": "10px",
          "width": "fit-content"
         },
         "blockId": "a2b1db6c7e",
         "blockName": "Para",
         "children": [],
         "classes": [],
         "customAttributes": {},
         "element": "p",
         "innerHTML": "Most of the web is in a hurry. Pages race to interrupt - a banner, a modal, a request to subscribe before you've read a single sentence. The slow web does the opposite. It assumes you came to read, and it gets out of the way.",
         "mobileStyles": {},
         "rawStyles": {},
         "tabletStyles": {}
        },
        {
         "attributes": {},
         "baseStyles": {
          "color": "var(--310ed7bb-04f5-4db6-bf5c-f73415698b5a, #1B1815)",
          "fontFamily": "Fraunces",
          "fontSize": "28px",
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "height": "fit-content",
          "letterSpacing": "-0.01em",
          "lineHeight": "1.4",
          "minWidth": "10px",
          "paddingTop": "12px",
          "width": "fit-content"
         },
         "blockId": "d0ed6ef261",
         "blockName": "Sub 1",
         "children": [],
         "classes": [],
         "customAttributes": {},
         "element": "h2",
         "innerHTML": "What restraint buys you",
         "mobileStyles": {},
         "rawStyles": {},
         "tabletStyles": {}
        },
        {
         "attributes": {},
         "baseStyles": {
          "color": "var(--310ed7bb-04f5-4db6-bf5c-f73415698b5a, #1B1815)",
          "fontFamily": "Lora",
          "fontSize": "19px",
          "height": "fit-content",
          "lineHeight": "1.75",
          "minWidth": "10px",
          "width": "fit-content"
         },
         "blockId": "60daa09576",
         "blockName": "Para",
         "children": [],
         "classes": [],
         "customAttributes": {},
         "element": "p",
         "innerHTML": "Every element you remove is one less thing between the reader and the words. Restraint isn't austerity - it's confidence that the writing can carry the page.",
         "mobileStyles": {},
         "rawStyles": {},
         "tabletStyles": {}
        },
        {
         "attributes": {},
         "baseStyles": {
          "borderLeftColor": "var(--a993a364-56af-4c34-b2c8-85ffaee59a7f, #9E2B25)",
